        PolicyHash: string
        -- A resource policy helps you to define the IAM entity (for example, an
        -- Amazon Web Services account) that can manage your Systems Manager resources. Currently, OpsItemGroup is the
        -- only resource that supports Systems Manager resource policies. The resource policy for
        -- OpsItemGroup enables Amazon Web Services accounts to view and interact with OpsCenter operational
        -- work items (OpsItems).
